{
  "comment": "One disk device or shell startup file written with repeated slashes or . and .. segments gets the same verdict as the plain spelling. Read by test/destructive_path_spellings.test.js and the Python test_destructive_path_spellings.py. Only text is checked, nothing is run. Fake device names and example.invalid only.",
